Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-tk, libhamlib-utils
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: JavierIOM <168463555+JavierIOM@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/JavierIOM/sunmoon
Description: easy calibration of your rotator using the sun or moon
 SunMoon points your antenna at the sun or moon through hamlib's rotctl, keeps
 it tracking, and lets you nudge it with the arrow keys until it's dead on.
 Mark the reading and it tells you how far out your rotator is, plus the
 rotctl -o/-O flags that correct it.
